#   Claude Code's 2026-09-29 test confirmed it reaches only the supplier-db and Supplier containers,
#   and supplier-db came up on port 5434 when I ran the compose file myself.
# Tool: Claude Code (model: Claude Opus 5.5), date: 2026-09-30
